<title>INDIA: India Larsen, Hindalco set 1st half results dates.</title>
<headline>India Larsen, Hindalco set 1st half results dates.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Indian blue chips Larsen &amp; Toubro and Hindalco on Monday announced the dates for releasing their results for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Aluminium maker Hindalco will announce its first half results on November 18 and engineering giant Larsen will release its results on November 22, the firms told the Bombay Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
